      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟训练员一同努力修行时，\r\n曾窥见了「火水合一」的境地……\r\n我片刻不曾忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "302f1a914de6b3950605c8e79c29fd7e1ae2786677846d25494aa72f70870f2b",
