    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f61e1d9df6fcf67a03e96128",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能遇见良师是我无可取代的宝物。\r\n居然在跑步这条路上也能拥有优秀的\r\n师父，我真是太受眷顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1927b308ca3f727400d399b2915dffb0f5e6eac6141a15a24fe410f1d10e9846",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1072/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c221252db6b92981799adc60",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还不够成熟，不足以压抑自身的\r\n「烈火」……说来惭愧，\r\n往后也请你多加指导鞭策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2f69ef1e186333e66e95b205e07f3687d2d7802088472156fca3dd51c71962",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1072/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e4dde359521b12f9dbda14",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n一年之计在于元旦……\r\n即使天寒，我仍要努力修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7855964ee0a6d0b3eceb1e714dfcc736c994cd6bc7e6041fe3f636928120b396",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
